    "text": "Up and Coming Weekly\nwebsite\nLumber Bridge\nCelebrate 11th Annual Day of the Cowboy Rodeo\nBy Sheila D. Barker,\n1 days agoGet ready for the 11th Annual Day of the Cowboy Rodeo on July 25 and 26. Gates open at 5 p.m. and the show starts at 8 p.m. This event is being held at the 7 Branch Farm and Arena at 62 McGougan Rd. in Lumber Bridge, NC. 7 Branch...\n1",
